                "entry_id": "3538101d-caf4-3540-97b6-0f4867c94d7a",
                "word": "mellophone",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2054bb43-e42e-4477-8bcf-283aa1d5e7a4",
                        "entry_id": "3538101d-caf4-3540-97b6-0f4867c94d7a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "mellophones"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4dcaddb2-b05e-364e-9ee4-f7776bb96da1",
                        "entry_id": "3538101d-caf4-3540-97b6-0f4867c94d7a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Instrument de musique de la famille des cuivres, utilisé à la place du cor d’harmonie par des fanfares et dans les défilés, parce qu’il est plus facile à jouer en marchant et que le son est projeté vers l’avant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "10fb17d4-e098-414c-b160-494201d9d5df",
                                "sense_id": "4dcaddb2-b05e-364e-9ee4-f7776bb96da1",
                                "text": "Bruno Frassanito fera usage de son mellophone, un instrument de la famille des cuivres et qui remplaçait le cor d’harmonie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e91e0aed-3dcc-4827-9f4e-a4a004434d5a",
                                "sense_id": "4dcaddb2-b05e-364e-9ee4-f7776bb96da1",
                                "text": "Manu Domergue chante et joue du mellophone, un instrument rare en France, proche du cor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "333669ab-b256-43e9-982f-f1bb439f9fe9",
                                "sense_id": "4dcaddb2-b05e-364e-9ee4-f7776bb96da1",
                                "text": "Sur la photo déjà évoquée, à gauche de Johnny Dodds figure David Jones (1888-1953) tenant un mellophone (instrument ressemblant à s’y méprendre à un cor d'harmonie, French horn en anglais)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "622def4b-830d-4b5c-ac1b-86308daf15eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "3538101d-caf4-3540-97b6-0f4867c94d7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "4dcaddb2-b05e-364e-9ee4-f7776bb96da1",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mellophon",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b7e5e27-a111-41d6-bbfd-0ee54f01a4ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "3538101d-caf4-3540-97b6-0f4867c94d7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "4dcaddb2-b05e-364e-9ee4-f7776bb96da1",
                        "target_lang_word": "mellophone",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mellophone",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7987abfc-4182-353a-827f-5ab441dca0c5",
                                        "entry_id": "9aa9d73b-b141-34ff-ae01-e07a870e1788",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brass instrument frequently used in place of the French horn in marching bands and similar performance groups."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af446c84-5d80-4830-b77b-d8c6f3fb7d29",
                                                "sense_id": "7987abfc-4182-353a-827f-5ab441dca0c5",
                                                "text": "On the issue of the mellophone being used as an introductory instrument for a beginning French horn student you must consider the fact that although they look similar, the instruments are entirely different."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a76cb297-8f51-459c-bc20-ce02e9270593",
                                                "sense_id": "7987abfc-4182-353a-827f-5ab441dca0c5",
                                                "text": "A pupil wishing to study the French horn will make more rapid progress by having at least a year's experience on the mellophone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "800f5744-9dc3-42b4-ab65-4929aadd1e5a",
                                                "sense_id": "7987abfc-4182-353a-827f-5ab441dca0c5",
                                                "text": "[…] yet for concert work I much prefer the mellophone (where French horns are not available) played in a creditable manner to the upright alto as played by some of the alto players I have heard who pose musicians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
